  <section class="impact-strip"><div class="container impact-inner"><div class="impact-intro"><Sprout :size="27"/><span>每一份被珍惜的食物，<br><strong>都是社区向前的一小步。</strong></span></div><div class="impact-number"><strong>{{impact.completed_batches.toLocaleString()}}<em>批</em></strong><span>已完成食品交接</span></div><div class="impact-number"><strong>{{impact.completed_weight_kg.toLocaleString()}}<em>kg</em></strong><span>接收方填报的交接重量</span></div><div class="impact-number"><strong>{{impact.completed_claims.toLocaleString()}}<em>次</em></strong><span>双方已确认的认领</span></div><div class="impact-disclaimer">试点真实记录<br>不将预计量当作实际影响</div></div></section>
  <section id="discover" class="section container"><div class="section-top"><div><div class="eyebrow">FIND GOOD FOOD</div><h2>余量不多，心意刚好。</h2><p>发现社区里等待被接住的好食物。</p></div><div class="location-label"><MapPin :size="16"/>社区余量分享网络</div></div><div class="discovery-tools"><div class="chips"><button v-for="[value,label] in categories" :key="value" :class="{selected:category===value}" @click="category=value">{{label}}</button></div><label class="search-box"><Search :size="17"/><input v-model="search" placeholder="搜索食品、地区或商家" aria-label="搜索余量食品"/><SlidersHorizontal :size="16"/></label></div><div v-if="loading" class="food-grid"><div v-for="n in 3" :key="n" class="skeleton"></div></div><div v-else-if="error" class="empty-state" role="alert"><Leaf :size="34"/><h3>暂时没有连接上</h3><p>{{error}}</p><button class="button small" @click="load">重新加载</button></div><div v-else-if="!filtered.length" class="empty-state"><Sprout :size="38"/><h3>{{items.length?'还没有匹配的余量':'第一份分享，正在等待你。'}}</h3><p>{{items.length?'换一个关键词或类别再看看。':'当前暂无可认领批次。加入社区，发布第一份可分享的好食物。'}}</p><RouterLink v-if="!items.length" to="/share" class="button small">发布食品余量 <ArrowUpRight :size="16"/></RouterLink></div><div v-else class="food-grid"><BatchCard v-for="batch in filtered" :key="batch.id" :batch="batch"/></div><p class="section-footnote">食品数量与可领取时段由发布方提供。认领前请与发布方确认储存要求及过敏原信息。</p></section>
